```

`[FACT]` Lossy mappings are precedent-normal: GeoJSON turns QuPath ellipses into polygons [S09]; NGFF label overlap has documented last-entry semantics [S07]. `[VALIDATION]` W7 (UNEXECUTED): export→re-import round-trip equality test on coordinates/frames, plus a hostile case: an annotation whose geometry type our GUI cannot produce (multi-segment disconnected line, per QuPath #2115 [S16,S17]) must export or fail loudly — never corrupt the file or recurse.

