## 14. Source discipline

Every load-bearing external claim above cites a catalog id `[Sxx]`; `sources.json` records URL, version pin, exact locator, capture identity (sha256 of the exact HTTP response body captured on 2026-10-05, capture id, and whether the capture is complete — four captures were truncated by the fetch cap and are marked, with the used content verified inside the captured range). Search-result captures are used only as locators to issue/timeline captures. No repair history is asserted beyond what the captured commits/releases show; the QuPath chain is explicitly reported as fix-without-found-regression-test and unreleased as of the capture date.
